    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Arancini are built in stages: a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "soffritto ",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "soffritto"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "-based meat ragu, a saffron risotto that is cooked and cooled, then the formed "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "arancini",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "arancini-shape"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " are crumbed and deep-fried until golden. The stages can be spread across two days. Makes about 12."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Cold risotto is essential for shaping. Trying to shape warm rice results in arancini that fall apart in the oil."
          }
        ]
      },
